{"unit_id":"AythyaCrispus__dsh-browser-use-native#card-zh","repo":"AythyaCrispus/dsh-browser-use-native","commit":"1b3ce391280db57bcc972181422df1634f8dc607","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-use-native（DSH 浏览器工具插件）：它在 DSH Host 中通过 Playwright 驱动 Chromium，并向模型注册浏览器操作工具。核心能力包括读取可聚焦的无障碍快照、按稳定 uid 点击和填写页面元素、等待页面状态、管理多个标签页，以及查看 console 和网络请求。适合需要让 DSH 自动浏览网页、填写表单或保存页面文件的场景。运行需要本机可用的 Chrome、Edge 或 Playwright Chromium；配置可选持久化浏览器 profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:109-438","index.js:573-630","lib/browser.js:160-220"]}
{"unit_id":"AythyaCrispus__dsh-browser-use-native#card-en","repo":"AythyaCrispus/dsh-browser-use-native","commit":"1b3ce391280db57bcc972181422df1634f8dc607","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-browser-use-native adds Playwright-powered Chromium tools to DSH. It lets the model inspect accessibility snapshots, click and fill page elements by uid, wait for page states, manage tabs, inspect browser logs, and save downloads. A local browser is required; persistent profiles are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:109-438","index.js:573-630","lib/browser.js:160-220"]}
